      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9cb9fd7aced82ae239d51794"
      },
      "index": 12,
      "text": "Or the opposite Dr. Murad, we may not be fully convinced that she's trustworthy but at least we know that 'circumstances' did not cloud Darius thinking.\n\nUnless anyone objects, I shall do the talking with her during this contract.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "Very well Sumire.",
          "conditions": null,
